    "body": [
      "⚠️ *Common Trap (Fettnäpfchen): Confusing 24 (vierundzwanzig) and 42 (zweiundvierzig*). Always read the units digit first in German!",
      "🧠 Memory Hook: Notice the spelling of dreißig (30) — it is the ONLY decade that uses -ßig instead of -zig!",
      "🇩🇪 *Cultural Insight (Kulturtipp): Cash is still king (Bargeld ist König*) in small German bakeries and kiosks. Always carry coins!"
